    section6_localDiscovery: "Local discovery in Panchagarh is anchored around prominent commercial centers, thoroughfares, and growing residential neighborhoods. In central Panchagarh Sadar, busy hubs such as Panchagarh Sadar and Tetulia host a dense cluster of established beauty parlours, makeover studios, and men's barbershops. Beyond the central core, residents in upazilas including Panchagarh Sadar, Tetulia, Boda, Debiganj, Atwari can readily discover verified local beauty professionals who bring quality salon treatments close to home. Whether you need a swift haircut near Panchagarh Sadar or complete wedding styling around Tetulia, Parloora's location filters help you locate nearby beauty partners across Panchagarh's verified neighborhoods without relying on word-of-mouth guesswork or tedious inquiries.",
    section7_tips: "A successful salon appointment in Panchagarh begins with thoughtful planning and open communication. For weddings, Eid preparations, or family celebrations, secure your parlour booking at least two to three weeks in advance, as popular makeup artists and stylists fill their calendars rapidly during peak seasons. Arrive approximately ten minutes before your designated appointment time so your beautician can inspect your skin or hair condition and discuss your preferences without rushing. If you have sensitive skin, allergies to specific hair dyes, or particular styling requirements, communicate these details clearly before treatment starts. Bringing digital photo references of your desired haircut, makeup style, or nail design will help your stylist deliver the exact look you envision.",
